Third-party data and fonts used by Sapu
=======================================

Each entry names the source, its license, and what Sapu uses from it.
The full license text follows each entry.

The Go modules linked into the sapu binary, with their full license texts,
are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES (generated by "make notices").

kondo
-----
Source:  https://github.com/tbillington/kondo
License: MIT
Used in: rules/purge/types.yml. The list of project types, their marker files
         and their artifact folders is adapted from kondo's kondo-lib. Folders
         were dropped or renamed where Sapu needs one folder name per artifact
         or where a folder can hold user data; python virtualenvs, cabal and
         cocoapods were split out or added. No kondo code is used.

