Fonts
-----
DM Sans and DM Mono are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. They are
used by the Sapu Mac app and website, not by the command-line tool, and no
font file is in the sapu binary. The full licenses are at
https://github.com/google/fonts/blob/main/ofl/dmsans/OFL.txt and
https://github.com/google/fonts/blob/main/ofl/dmmono/OFL.txt.
